	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Verbis assequi non possum, reverende in Christo pater, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quantum me tibi pro tua erga me benevolentia <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et humanitate debere agnoscam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nisi enim tu <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>esses, hic viveremus omnium rerum ignari; adde, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quod literae tuae insuper mirifice me afficiunt.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Hosce dies singularem gravedinem et animi et <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>corporis sensi, quam subinde graviorem me contrahere <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>necesse est, qui scilicet consuetudine et familiaritate <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>doctorum virorum caream, quod unum satis est ad vigo<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>rem ingenii contundendum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Accedunt sexcenta alia, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quae hic praeterea.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tuae solius literae me mihi restituu<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed quid habeo, quo te remunerer.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Cessationem <placeName ref="l834">Italorum</placeName> audisti; sed scribam tamen <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et illis calcar subdam; in caeteris mire sunt offitiosi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et, prout sunt suspicaces, aliquando de re minima <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>maximas excitant tragoedias; in re tam gravi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et seria mussant et silent.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In nuptiis <foreign xml:lang="de">(by der <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>aabetschencke)</foreign> assedit mihi praepositus collegii huius; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>is dicebat ad se perscriptum pontificem 10 circiter <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>millia peditum <placeName ref="l834">Italorum</placeName> decrevisse <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentum</placeName> mittere, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quibus <persName>Philippus</persName> additurus sit mille equites et ex eo <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l822">Germanos</placeName> quoque principes consilia capere, ut <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>mature, si qua vis fieret, eam repellant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Haec <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ille; ego nihil certi habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Perscriptum est etiam ad d. <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName>Philippum</persName> collegam <persName ref="p18575">Philippum Hispanum</persName> amisisse <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>insulas Oceani occidentalis et propterea in maxima <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>esse trepidatione et expeditione.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quod si verum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>esset, <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> quietius ageret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quae in vestris <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>literis sunt de regis <placeName ref="l1209">Navarrae</placeName> inconstantia, invitissimus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>audivi et vix ausim hic apud nostros proferre.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Si bellum ingrueret, res haec una maximum hostibus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ad victoriam momentum afferret.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Humano more <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>loquor.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Aha<note type="misc">Asa?</note> dicebat: "Domine, nihil refert apud te, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>ut auxilium feras vel multis vel his, quibus non est <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>robur.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Fer opem nobis, o domine deus noster.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Scire cupis, quid cum principe <placeName ref="l572">Wirtenbergico</placeName> egerim; sed nuper <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>nihil certi significare potui.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Interea scripsit <persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName> ad <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>d. consulem <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosium</persName> et ad d. <persName>Philippum</persName> collegam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>In literis <persName>Philippi</persName> haec sunt: "<persName ref="p8093">Herculis</persName>, <persName ref="p8009">Fabricii</persName>, <persName ref="p2019">Maynardi</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><persName ref="p8022">Nigri</persName> literas ad principem misi; nam hi ad principem <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>scripserunt ipsi." Haec ille; sed dubito ego, an mea <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>principi sint reddita, propterea quod primo omnia <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>in manus <persName ref="p3375">Vergerii</persName> venerunt; sed tamen is affirmat <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>reddita omnia et principem per se (id est <persName ref="p3375">Vergerium</persName>), <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>cum illum ad nos miserit, responsurum ad singula.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Deinde in progressu haec erant: "Tu a <persName ref="p8009">Fabricio</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>impetrabis, ne ea, quae principes cum <placeName ref="l648">Rhaetis</placeName> agunt, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ipse propalet; nam si rescirent hoc principes <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>aegre ferrent.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sed de his coram plura" etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Nimirum aliquid <placeName ref="l587">Tiguro</placeName> emanavit, ad quod ille <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>alludit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Deinde additum erat exemplar literarum <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>principis ad <persName ref="p3375">Vergerium</persName>, quarum haec summa: <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>"Expectamus literas a <persName ref="p18090">rege Navarrae</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>et tunc vos aut in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> proficiscemini aut <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>in <placeName ref="l648">Rhętiam</placeName>" etc.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Scripsit ad consulem et rogat, <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>ut ei liceat <placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> typographiam instituere; promisit <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>plura ministris <placeName ref="l648">Rhaetis</placeName> pauperioribus nomine <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>principis.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Habes omnia, quae tibi servabis et caute uteris; <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>nam haec clam esse volo, quo possim plura subinde <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>expiscari.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Alias, si sciret me vobiscum communicare, <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>non concrederet arcana.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Quid autem homo ille quaerat, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>exitus docebit.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Te apud <persName ref="p629">Coignetium</persName> vigilare necesse est; <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>timeo, ne vi conentur nobis hunc fumivenditorem <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>obtrudere.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende pater, cum tuis omnibus quam <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>felicissime et diutissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z31"/>Nunc accipio literas ab <persName ref="p6769">Augustino Talpio</persName>, qui se edoceri <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>cupit de suis rebus; sed ego scripsi ad communitatem <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>necdum responsum tuli.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Sed rogo te, ei dicas, veniat <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>primo <placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName>, et interim spero me responsum <lb xml:id="p2z35"/>habiturum.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Vacant et alię conditiones etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Iam vespera appetebat, cum literae <placeName ref="l176">Glarona</placeName> veniunt, quibus <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>iubeor <persName ref="p3375">P. P. Vergerium</persName> commonere de insidiis sibi structis, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>si denuo ad <placeName ref="l648">Rhetos</placeName> iter instituat.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Communicavi <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>cum consulibus; nam et ad illos spectant; iussus sum <lb xml:id="p3z5"/>scribere ad <persName ref="p3375">Vergerium</persName> et eum commonere.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Videtur haec <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>occasio divinitus oblata; nam hanc unam video <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>rationem eum prohibendi et a <placeName ref="l648">Rhetia</placeName> arcendi etc.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z8"/>Quod Coignetius non venit, in causa fuit hactenus <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>coniugis valetudo, quae letaliter decubuit.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <lb xml:id="p3z10"/><persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z11"/>Remitto omnia; nescio tamen, cui dare possim.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z12"/>Domin<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>o <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName><lb xml:id="p4z2"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
